<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ROWLEY INJURY HITS WALES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ROWLEY INJURY HITS WALES.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Welsh lock Mark Rowley will miss his side's final Five Nations game against England on Saturday week.</p>
<p>Rowley fractured his left wrist playing for his club Pontypridd against Swansea on Sunday.</p>
</text>
